{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么又突然全校集会……？”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4319", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长随兴所为……这个理由我说不出口，只能简单安抚濑名同学。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看着台上的母亲，眼神充满了烦躁。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家，早喔！”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0598", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早安～！”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "女子一同", "alt_speaker_idx": 440, "voice": "go075h", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "开场第一句话就让濑名同学按着眉头不爽了。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么，今天要很罕见地说说正经的话题啰～”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0599", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“正经的学园长也好棒啊～～～～！”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ja0102", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请再多责骂我们一点～～！”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "sa0048", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈，那是怎样？”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ht0579", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各务台的女生们都已经被濑名学园长调教了。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到同学们的反应，濑名同学……", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4320", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个眼神，现在还是不要跟她说话比较好。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算被称为狂犬也一点都不奇怪的凶狠。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘那么，接下来要说正经的事了。’", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0600", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "短暂的沉默后，学园长真的很罕见地板起脸。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘最近，好像出现了把小猫丢弃在这所学校里的罪大恶极之徒呢～’", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0601", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长开门见山地说，底下的学生们窃窃私语起来。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘心里有底的人请举手。’", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0602", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "礼堂内瞬间变得安静无声。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，没有人举手。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……我相信我们学校的学生没有会做出那种事情的人。’", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0603", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘所以，接下来我说的话，就当作是自言自语来听吧。’", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0604", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才还按着眉头的濑名同学，此时也认真地注视着学园长。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘在这里的女孩子们，很多人今后都会谈一场美好的恋爱，然后生下心爱的男人的小宝宝吧。’", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0605", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我也是那样的。’", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0606", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘虽然那之后发生了很多事……不过对于承受剧痛从自己肚子里生下的孩子，一定是疼爱有加的喔。’", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0607", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4321", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘弃养小猫的人类，或许是觉得只不过是猫而已。’", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0608", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘但是啊，如果以为这样想能让自己心里好过一点，那就大错特错了喔。’", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0609", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘如果弃养小猫心里还觉得无所谓的话……那个人一定是把作为一个人来说重要的东西丢弃了。’", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0610", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘人类是一种非常迟钝的生物。’", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0611", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘只不过是猫？不对喔，弃养小猫的家伙对人类也会做出一样的事情。’", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0612", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘会对疼痛变得迟钝喔。不懂生命的重量，连自己的生命也不珍惜的人类……’", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0613", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长为了我们站在讲台上。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直率的，和濑名同学一样直来直往的话语戳入我的胸口。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "礼堂里保持安静的大家一定也跟我有相同的感受。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我不希望从这所学校毕业的学生变成那样的人。’", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0614", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘觉得我是空有理想也没关系。’", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0615", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘但是……’", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0616", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘你们从这里毕业过了几年、几十年后也可以。’", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0617", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我希望当你们成为父亲和母亲的时候，能够想起我的自言自语就好了。’", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0618", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……以上。不好意思讲了这么久。我的话说完了。’", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "rk0619", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，濑名学园长干脆地离开讲台。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使过了好一会，礼堂里也没有人发出声音。", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……什么嘛，耍什么帅啊。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4322", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我身旁的濑名同学打破沉默，转身背对我。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的背影，和学园长非常相似。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天早上的全校集会，一定是为了我们而召开的吧。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，太突然了，我吓了一跳。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1105", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一天，我们直到放学后都在聊学园长的话题。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉经过这次的事件，学园长的粉丝又要增加了。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是其中一个。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是说出来的话好像会惹濑名同学不高兴，所以我只在心中承认。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“希望这样一来，今后不会再有人弃养猫了……”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，能这样的话就好了……”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1106", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～噜～”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "pn0352", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经不想再看到美羽学姐悲伤的样子了。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她那双伤痕累累的手，更让我加深了这个想法。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了，新吾君，你明天有时间吗？”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1107", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有，明天没什么事……”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那下午要不要来我家？我想答谢你之前在我生病时照顾……”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1108", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然说是答谢，但也没办法做什么厉害的事就是了♪”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1109", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐突然的邀约让我愣住了。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这不是在作梦吧？", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我居然被邀请去学姐家……", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，你不用太紧张喔。我的家人都不严肃，轻松一点没关系。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1110", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，如果是新吾君，一定可以跟我妈妈也相处得融洽的～”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1111", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有点意外。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为学姐看起来就是个大小姐，给人家教很严厉的印象。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么样呢？如果新吾君不排斥的话……”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1112", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我完全不排斥。不会给你添麻烦的话，请让我去打扰。”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的？谢谢你♪”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1113", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～噜～♪”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "pn0353", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的这个笑容，让我都想答谢她了呢。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，太猛了。爱理的妈妈，棒透了！”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1235", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊～安洁也觉得好猛啊！不愧是爱理同学的母亲呢！”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3416", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名家到底要让安洁着迷到什么程度才甘心啊？”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3417", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理的妈妈，好棒。”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "sk1295", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不要再夸了啦，好不舒服。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4323", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过濑名同学看起来其实很高兴。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接下来就是必须找到愿意领养小新吾的饲主了。”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1114", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "pn0354", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾跟熊喵靠着彼此，睡得很舒服的样子。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "猫的睡脸真的好疗愈喔。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是看着内心就产生了幸福的感觉。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，认识的人都问过了吧？”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4324", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊，要在结女里找饲主可能比较难了。”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1236", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我有去询问妈妈认识的人了，希望那边能有好的答覆……”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1115", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看来我也去问问亲戚之类的比较好。”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4325", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁也会努力去问♪”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3418", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也……”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，等一下！”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1237", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4326", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，纱凪？”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4327", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所有人都不解地看着她。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，新吾……啊，是指猫喔。我可以领养吗……”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1238", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪，你是说……”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1116", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐，抱歉。我好像已经对新吾放太多感情了……”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1239", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪对学姐深深地低下头。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果纱凪可以我是没意见啦……”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4328", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“让小纱同学领养的话，大家也能放心呢！”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ag3419", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃呢？”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4329", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“非常放心。”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "sk1296", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我也不反对，但是美羽学姐的表情却有一层阴影。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐觉得呢？”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我……”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1117", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看了纱凪一眼，然后又沉默。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么回事？如果是纱凪，应该能放心交给她才对……", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐，拜托你！我真的很喜欢新吾！”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1240", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请让我养新吾吧！”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1241", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1118", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐！”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1242", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人沉默地看着对方。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后纱凪率先点点头，一会后美羽学姐也同样点点头。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那么，新吾就交给小纱凪了，可以吗？”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "mu1119", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你！我会很疼爱它的！”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1243", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到纱凪这么开心，我也感到高兴。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵抱歉喔。新吾就由我来给它幸福了。”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1244", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～噜～♪”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "pn0355", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4330", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在大家都开开心心的时候，我发现濑名同学一脸复杂的表情。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，濑名同学？”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，没事，什么都没有。”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4331", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 478, "voice": "ar4332", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂、欸！等一下啦，那边的！”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1245", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一个人走在回家的路上，听见背后传来急促的脚步声。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看到你超级寂寞的背影，忍不住就开口叫你了。”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1246", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，因为樱乃和濑名同学一起回家了。身为哥哥实在有点寂寞。”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿嘿～活该！你就这样孤独死比较好。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1247", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪把黑猫装在社团备品的笼子里，很慎重地抱着。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你刚才跑着过来，新吾有没有吓到？”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，是吗？新吾，抱歉喔～”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1248", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "黒猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～咪～”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "黑猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 502, "voice": "bc0024", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从笼子的小窗看着新吾，纱凪露出了笑容。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，我真的吓了一跳。没想到纱凪会这么喜欢新吾……”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对人类新吾倒是完全不喜欢。”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1249", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这部分，只要你好好爱猫咪新吾就够了。”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用你说我也会疼它疼到骨子里的！”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1250", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起纱凪在社团中与新吾的互动，我觉得她说的一点也没有夸张。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望她不要太宠猫，结果让猫变得不受控……", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～对了，新吾，明天有空吗？”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1251", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果有时间的话，陪我去买东西……”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1252", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，抱歉。明天美羽学姐邀我去她家……”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话才刚出口，我立刻惊觉不妙。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这件事应该不要告诉纱凪才对。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……是吗，这样啊。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1253", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经做好了被飞踢的觉悟，但纱凪却冷静到让我害怕。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这该不会就是所谓的暴风雨前的宁静……", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要是对美羽学姐做出奇怪的事情我不会放过你。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1254", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“反正一个人去买东西还比较轻松～”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1255", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然是想叫你来帮忙提东西啦。”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1256", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她没有像以前一样对美羽学姐的事情做出激烈反应。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁思考起她的心境到底起了什么变化。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，那我要回家和新吾卿卿我我了～”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1257", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也和美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这家伙，杀了你喔！”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "sn1258", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 164, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……心境的变化，我完全感觉不到。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
